[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11460.63, "timestamp": "03:11:00", "text": "很好的向导。其实，我刚醒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11464.71, "timestamp": "03:11:04", "text": "大概一个小时前，或者差不多一个小时前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11467.71, "timestamp": "03:11:07", "text": "直播前大约15分钟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11471.11, "timestamp": "03:11:11", "text": "溪流。所以，我当时有点晚了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11473.03, "timestamp": "03:11:13", "text": "今天是这样，但除此之外，一切都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11475.67, "timestamp": "03:11:15", "text": "好的。我命令我的部队"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11478.87, "timestamp": "03:11:18", "text": "不惜一切代价重新夺回它。我们不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11482.07, "timestamp": "03:11:22", "text": "让它继续留在敌人手中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11484.87, "timestamp": "03:11:24", "text": "马拉万正在袭击这家商店。该死的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11486.87, "timestamp": "03:11:26", "text": "你就不能给我留下一件好事吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11492.79, "timestamp": "03:11:32", "text": "马拉湾？就一杯该死的咖啡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11497.269, "timestamp": "03:11:37", "text": "你只需写一行字，我就能收到你的订单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11499.79, "timestamp": "03:11:39", "text": "那枚手榴弹真是太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11503.83, "timestamp": "03:11:43", "text": "愚蠢的。我认为我不应该使用“我”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11517.349, "timestamp": "03:11:57", "text": "不，我们干掉了一个小角色。但"}]